{"3460820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tropic Industry", "steam_appid": 3460820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The sun rises. Humid air hangs over your fields.</strong><br>What starts as a small plantation can become the heart of an entire industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tropic Industry</strong> takes you to where it all begins: the source of raw materials.<br>Here, it’s not about how much you grow — it’s about what you turn it into.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Plantation to Industry</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin with a small plantation on a tropical island.<br>Step by step, you expand it into a complex production system of cultivation, processing, and export.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coffee, cocoa, sugarcane, bananas, tobacco, cotton, vanilla —<br>everything grows under your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But raw materials alone have little value.<br>Real industry begins with processing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Real Production Lines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct specialized buildings and connect them into efficient chains:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plantations — large-scale, efficient, specialized</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Processing facilities — fermenters, roasters, presses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storage and logistics systems</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize routes, reduce downtime, and keep your production running.<br>Downtime costs money. Efficiency drives growth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Think Like an Entrepreneur</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a traditional farming game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scale what works</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replace what slows you down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to demand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a stable export economy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t master everything at once.<br>And that’s where the challenge lies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on plantation industry rather than traditional farming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-stage production chains with clear progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse tropical resources with unique processing paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and optimize complex industrial systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logistics and resource flow as core mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow from a small operation into a full-scale industry</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn a simple plantation into a powerful industrial operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your production, refine your processes, and build a system that grows — and endures.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The sun rises. Humid air hangs over your fields.</strong><br>What starts as a small plantation can become the heart of an entire industry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tropic Industry</strong> takes you to where it all begins: the source of raw materials.<br>Here, it’s not about how much you grow — it’s about what you turn it into.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Plantation to Industry</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin with a small plantation on a tropical island.<br>Step by step, you expand it into a complex production system of cultivation, processing, and export.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coffee, cocoa, sugarcane, bananas, tobacco, cotton, vanilla —<br>everything grows under your control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But raw materials alone have little value.<br>Real industry begins with processing.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Real Production Lines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct specialized buildings and connect them into efficient chains:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plantations — large-scale, efficient, specialized</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Processing facilities — fermenters, roasters, presses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storage and logistics systems</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize routes, reduce downtime, and keep your production running.<br>Downtime costs money. Efficiency drives growth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Think Like an Entrepreneur</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a traditional farming game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scale what works</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replace what slows you down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to demand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a stable export economy</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t master everything at once.<br>And that’s where the challenge lies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus on plantation industry rather than traditional farming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multi-stage production chains with clear progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse tropical resources with unique processing paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and optimize complex industrial systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logistics and resource flow as core mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow from a small operation into a full-scale industry</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn a simple plantation into a powerful industrial operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your production, refine your processes, and build a system that grows — and endures.</p>", "short_description": "Build your tropical industry. Grow, process, and export resources — from simple plantations to complex production chains. Optimize logistics, increase efficiency, and grow your business into a global export network.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460820/9cfc46604dd11b3ef1a4873e55206e488e93b28c/header.jpg?t=1788212965", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460820/53ff695c1a136e0c75822e1ac3ab781fe0e3c584/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788212965", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460820/53ff695c1a136e0c75822e1ac3ab781fe0e3c584/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788212965", "website": "https://tropicindustry.zdgames.net/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 3 5xxx<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1080TI<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 7 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD recommended</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 5xxx<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 2080